{
  "scope": "P18 controlled frontend implementation and targeted validation only; no complete engineering seven, browser, installed native or real Agent result claimed.",
  "changes": [
    "Shared exact body-line LCS with 1,000,000 cells, exact string interning to integer IDs; comparison-only 2Mi UTF16 code-unit/20,000 combined physical-row bounds. Raw report retained.",
    "Precision aligned/replacement/missing-before/unavailable drives both views, stats and human-readable comparison copy; only aligned uses +/- coloring/statistics, replacement/missing neutral.",
    "Physical LF/CRLF/none endings remain distinct without phantom trailing row; endingChanges retains separate oldLine/newLine. Fragment-relative coordinates never derive offsets/full-file scope from tool locations.",
    "Explicit diff.path reuses MessageFileLink; render/search never reads disk. Existing scope/input/report/footer retained. Failed/pending/unknown main step labels are neutral, not completed tense.",
    "Physical-row before/after display and feedback input bounds synchronized; versioned content ID distinguishes missing versus empty and leaves old opinions under other revisions. Raw before/after copy remains byte-for-byte original text.",
    "Per-owner weak comparison cache and component memoization avoid repeated LCS on unrelated renders; no new persistent store, dependency or Agent-specific UI."
  ],
